{"seq":3,"slug":"geospatial-network-viz","title":"地理与网络可视化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/practice/geospatial-network-viz","wordCount":1826,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"地理与网络可视化\">地理与网络可视化</h1><p>地图和关系图是可视化里最难的两类。一张全国疫情热力图，要把经纬度投影到平面、要在缩放时切换地图瓦片、要在地图上叠加几十万个数据点还不卡；一张社交关系图，要为成千上万个节点算出互不重叠的布局、要让它在拖拽时实时响应。这两类图把整个 hub 的知识全用上了：地理可视化考验投影数学与 <a href=\"../interaction/large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 的 GPU 渲染，网络可视化考验布局算法与同样的性能功底。用它们为 hub 收尾，正是一次综合实战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>地理可视化的根本难题是把球面坐标（经纬度）映射到平面屏幕，这就是投影（projection）——本质上是 <a href=\"../foundations/data-prep-scales\">数据准备与比例尺</a> 讲的比例尺的二维球面版本，把地理坐标域映射到像素域。网络可视化的根本难题是布局（layout）——节点之间没有天然坐标，要靠算法（最常见是力导向）算出每个节点该放哪，使图既不重叠又能反映连接结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[地理可视化] --&gt; A1[投影&lt;br/&gt;球面经纬度到平面]&#10;  A --&gt; A2[底图&lt;br/&gt;瓦片或矢量地图]&#10;  A --&gt; A3[数据叠加&lt;br/&gt;点 热力 轨迹 分级填色]&#10;  A3 --&gt; A4[GPU 渲染海量点&lt;br/&gt;deck.gl]&#10;  B[网络可视化] --&gt; B1[布局&lt;br/&gt;力导向 层次 环形]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[节点边渲染&lt;br/&gt;视觉编码连接]&#10;  B1 --&gt; B3[大图性能&lt;br/&gt;聚类 LOD GPU]\">flowchart TD\n  A[地理可视化] --&gt; A1[投影&lt;br/&gt;球面经纬度到平面]\n  A --&gt; A2[底图&lt;br/&gt;瓦片或矢量地图]\n  A --&gt; A3[数据叠加&lt;br/&gt;点 热力 轨迹 分级填色]\n  A3 --&gt; A4[GPU 渲染海量点&lt;br/&gt;deck.gl]\n  B[网络可视化] --&gt; B1[布局&lt;br/&gt;力导向 层次 环形]\n  B --&gt; B2[节点边渲染&lt;br/&gt;视觉编码连接]\n  B1 --&gt; B3[大图性能&lt;br/&gt;聚类 LOD GPU]</pre><p>两类图与其核心技术、性能策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>核心数学</th>\n<th>主力工具</th>\n<th>性能策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地理-分级填色</td>\n<td>投影 + 顺序配色</td>\n<td>D3-geo、地图库</td>\n<td>简化几何、视口裁剪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理-海量点</td>\n<td>投影 + GPU 实例化</td>\n<td>deck.gl</td>\n<td>WebGL 批渲染、聚合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络-中小图</td>\n<td>力导向布局</td>\n<td>D3-force</td>\n<td>直接 SVG/Canvas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>网络-超大图</td>\n<td>布局 + 聚类</td>\n<td>图渲染引擎</td>\n<td>社区聚合、GPU、LOD</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"地理可视化-投影与底图\">地理可视化：投影与底图</h2><p>地球是个球，屏幕是个平面，把前者画到后者必然有失真——这是投影的宿命，不同投影在面积、角度、距离上各有取舍。墨卡托投影（Web 地图的默认）保持角度但严重夸大高纬度面积（格陵兰看起来和非洲一样大，实际小十几倍）；等积投影保持面积但扭曲形状。选投影要看图的目的：做导航用墨卡托，比较各国面积大小就绝不能用它，得用等积投影，否则违反 <a href=\"../foundations/visual-encoding-principles\">视觉编码与图形语法</a> 的表达力原则——用失真的面积误导读者。</p>\n<p>底图有两种范式。瓦片地图（raster/vector tiles）把地图切成一格格预渲染的图块，缩放时按层级加载，适合需要详细地理背景的场景。纯数据地图则只画 GeoJSON 的行政边界，用 D3-geo 投影后渲染成 SVG/Canvas 路径，适合分级填色（choropleth）这类只关心区域统计的图。分级填色把每个区域按其数值用 <a href=\"../foundations/perception-color\">感知、颜色与可读性</a> 的顺序配色填充，是最常见的地理图——但要注意它会让面积大的区域视觉权重过高，必要时用等值点或方块网格地图补偿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地理大数据-deck-gl-与-gpu\">地理大数据：deck.gl 与 GPU</h2><p>当地图上要叠加的不是几百个区域而是几十万个点、几百万条轨迹——出租车轨迹、物流网络、传感器读数——SVG 和 Canvas 2D 都撑不住，必须上 <a href=\"../interaction/large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 讲的 GPU 路线。这个领域 2026 年的事实标准是 deck.gl（最新 v9，基于 luma.gl v9，见 <a href=\"https://deck.gl/docs\">deck.gl 文档</a>）。</p>\n<p>deck.gl 的设计正是把地理数据叠加抽象成一层层可组合的 GPU 图层：散点图层、热力图层、弧线层、网格聚合层，每层都用 WebGL 实例化渲染（见 <a href=\"../interaction/large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a>）一次画出海量图元。它把投影、视口裁剪、LOD 都内置了——缩放时自动只渲染视口内的数据，平移时复用缓冲。2026 年 deck.gl v9 引入了 WebGPU 后端，其计算着色器可把聚合预处理也搬上 GPU，但官方明确 WebGPU 支持仍是 alpha、尚未生产就绪，所以生产环境仍以 WebGL2 为基线。</p>\n<p>对超大地理数据，还要叠加聚合：当点密到互相重叠时，按网格或六边形分箱聚合成密度图（呼应 <a href=\"../interaction/large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 讲的「过度绘制时换编码」），既解决性能又解决可读性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"网络可视化-力导向布局\">网络可视化：力导向布局</h2><p>网络（图）由节点和边构成，最大的挑战是节点没有天然坐标。力导向布局（force-directed layout）借物理模拟来解决：把节点当成互相排斥的带电粒子，把边当成把相连节点拉近的弹簧，让系统迭代到能量最低的平衡态，此时布局既舒展又能体现连接的紧密程度。</p>\n<p>排斥力常用类库仑力，两节点距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 时排斥力大小为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{rep} = \\frac{k_r}{d^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>边的吸引力常用类胡克弹簧力，与距离成正比：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{attr} = k_a \\cdot d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每次迭代对每个节点累加它受到的所有力，更新位置，反复直到收敛。D3-force 是这套模拟的标准实现，它把各种力（排斥、吸引、向心、碰撞）做成可叠加的模块。布局算完后，节点和边的渲染又回到 <a href=\"../rendering/svg-canvas-webgl\">SVG、Canvas 与 WebGL 取舍</a> 的选型：几百个节点用 SVG（可享受交互便利），上千就该转 Canvas。</p>\n<p>朴素力导向每次迭代要算所有节点对的排斥力，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，节点一多就慢。优化用 Barnes-Hut 近似：把空间用四叉树（又是 <a href=\"../interaction/interaction-patterns\">交互模式与状态管理</a> 的空间索引）划分，把远处一团节点近似成一个质心，把复杂度降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超大网络-聚类与降复杂度\">超大网络：聚类与降复杂度</h2><p>力导向在几千节点以内表现好，再大就会算不动、画出来也是「毛球」——节点边糊成一团毫无可读性。超大网络的出路不是画得更快，而是降低视觉复杂度，这与 <a href=\"../interaction/large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 「聪明地少画」的哲学完全一致。</p>\n<p>社区检测先把网络划分成若干内部紧密的社区，初始只渲染社区级的聚合节点，用户点开某个社区才展开其内部细节——这是网络版的细节层次（LOD）和「概览优先，按需细节」（见 <a href=\"../interaction/interaction-patterns\">交互模式与状态管理</a>）。边捆绑（edge bundling）把走向相近的边捆成束，大幅减少视觉杂乱。对真正巨大的图，则上专门的 GPU 图渲染引擎，把布局迭代和渲染都搬上 GPU。这些手段叠加，才能让百万节点的网络变得可读、可交互。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>地理与网络是最难的两类图，综合用上全 hub 的投影/比例尺、GPU 渲染、布局算法、性能与配色知识。</li>\n<li>地理可视化核心是投影：墨卡托保角度但夸大高纬面积，比较面积须用等积投影，否则违反表达力原则。</li>\n<li>底图分瓦片地图与纯数据地图；分级填色用顺序配色，但面积大的区域视觉权重过高需补偿。</li>\n<li>地理海量点用 deck.gl（v9 / luma.gl v9）GPU 图层叠加，内置投影/裁剪/LOD；WebGPU 后端仍 alpha，生产用 WebGL2。</li>\n<li>网络靠力导向布局：排斥力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{rep}=k_r/d^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、吸引力 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_{attr}=k_a d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 迭代到平衡；Barnes-Hut 用四叉树把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>超大网络靠社区聚类、LOD、边捆绑、GPU 引擎降低视觉与计算复杂度，呼应 <a href=\"../interaction/large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 的「聪明地少画」。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"地理与网络可视化","id":"地理与网络可视化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"地理可视化：投影与底图","id":"地理可视化-投影与底图"},{"level":2,"text":"地理大数据：deck.gl 与 GPU","id":"地理大数据-deck-gl-与-gpu"},{"level":2,"text":"网络可视化：力导向布局","id":"网络可视化-力导向布局"},{"level":2,"text":"超大网络：聚类与降复杂度","id":"超大网络-聚类与降复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可访问与响应式图表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/practice/accessible-responsive-charts"},"next":null}